SiCoPR — third-party material and upstream provenance
=====================================================

SiCoPR is a Python translation of the IEEE 802.3 Channel Operating Margin (COM)
MATLAB reference implementation. This file records exactly what it was
translated from, so that a reader can confirm they hold the same upstream bytes.

Licence terms are in LICENSE. This file is the provenance record, not a second
licence.


